{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in a warm, cozy world where time slows down and the matching tiles are your only worry. Featuring endless chill vibes and a delightful aesthetic, this is the perfect game to unwind, focus, and find your rhythm.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you have five minutes or an hour, put on your headphones and lose yourself in the gentle flow of Mahjong, backed by an original, calming lofi soundtrack.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udfb5 Original Lofi Soundtrack:</strong> A curated collection of smooth, low-fidelity beats designed to melt away anxiety and enhance concentration.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udc04 Customizable Boards &amp; Themes:</strong> Unlock a variety of beautiful tile sets and backgrounds. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83e\uddd8 Play at Your Own Pace:</strong> No timers, no pressure, no scoreboards. Just pure, unadulterated relaxation.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4089690?t=1768247518","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4089690/b026da140074c374083e1fc9712952459f81499d/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1768247518","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4089690/159392b2db2c2adc79700d4375692c5ddf198566/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768247518","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4089690/159392b2db2c2adc79700d4375692c5ddf198566/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768247518","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"c